      <title>两个风筝格局的整合：世俗财富与灵魂创伤</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/2026/04/%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E9%A3%8E%E7%AD%9D%E6%A0%BC%E5%B1%80%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B4%E5%90%88%E4%B8%96%E4%BF%97%E8%B4%A2%E5%AF%8C%E4%B8%8E%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%88%9B%E4%BC%A4/</link>
